    "thumbnail": "blog/how-we-chose-our-3rd-year-project-from-aivm-rover-to-smart-iv/images/product.png",
    "excerpt": "Smart IV was not our first 3YP idea. This is how we moved from an ambitious indoor mapping rover to a more feasible healthcare project, and what we learned about choosing a project before actually building one.",
