    "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600132806370-bf17e65e942f?w=600&q=80",
    "excerpt": "A hands-on practical guide to the Department of Computer Engineering's high-performance GPU servers, Ada and Ampere. Written as two tailored versions: one for experienced HPC users, and another for absolute beginners.",
